{"seq":8,"slug":"knowledge-management-pkm","title":"个人知识管理与笔记系统","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-systems","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 个人知识管理与笔记系统\n\n读过的书一年后只剩模糊印象，收藏夹里躺着几百篇再没打开的文章，好观点在需要时偏偏想不起来——这些日常的知识泄漏，是几乎每个知识工作者都在经历却又习以为常的损耗。个人知识管理（PKM）要做的，就是用一套个人化的流程把这些漏洞堵上：让有价值的信息被可靠捕获、被结构化存放、在需要时被找回，并最终转化为你自己的产出。\n\n这个 hub 按一条递进的主线展开，四章环环相扣，建议顺序阅读。\n\n第一章「PKM 基础」打地基：先讲清 PKM 到底是什么、为什么大脑需要把记忆外包给外部系统，再拆解信息流与四类笔记的分工，最后给出穿越工具更迭的选型原则。它回答「为何做、做什么、用什么」三个前置问题。\n\n第二章「笔记方法论」是核心方法：卡片盒笔记法教你让卡片彼此对话、随时间长出体系；渐进式总结教你按需分层压缩外部材料；常青笔记与原子化则确立了「一条笔记一个想法」的底层标准。这三套方法分别处理「组织想法」「消化材料」「打磨单元」，构成知识加工的流水线。\n\n第三章「系统搭建」把方法落成可运转的系统：双链与知识图谱让笔记织成可双向穿行的网，PARA 用「可行动性」而非主题来组织文件，标签与检索保证五千条笔记里也能三秒找回。三者分管微观互联、宏观组织与高效取用，缺一不可。\n\n第四章「实践与产出」让系统真正创造价值：从笔记到写作讲如何让积累的笔记流向文章，间隔重复与复习讲如何对付「记不住」，工作流自动化与维护讲如何让整套系统在时间侵蚀下持续健康。\n\n四章合起来是一个闭环——基础确立心态，方法沉淀知识，系统组织知识，实践把知识变成产出，而产出又回流为新的积累。理解这条「捕获→提炼→组织→表达→再积累」的复利循环，是读懂整个 hub 的钥匙。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"PKM 基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"essence-of-pkm","title":"个人知识管理的本质","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/foundations/essence-of-pkm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"info-flow-note-types","title":"信息流与笔记类型","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/foundations/info-flow-note-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tools-principles","title":"工具选择与原则","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/foundations/tools-principles"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"methods","title":"笔记方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"zettelkasten","title":"卡片盒笔记法","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/methods/zettelkasten"},{"seq":2,"slug":"progressive-summarization","title":"渐进式总结","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/methods/progressive-summarization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evergreen-atomic","title":"常青笔记与原子化","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/methods/evergreen-atomic"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统搭建","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backlinks-graph","title":"双链与知识图谱","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/systems/backlinks-graph"},{"seq":2,"slug":"para-organization","title":"PARA 与文件组织","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/systems/para-organization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tags-retrieval","title":"标签与检索","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/systems/tags-retrieval"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践与产出","docCount":3,"url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"notes-to-writing","title":"从笔记到写作","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/practice/notes-to-writing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spaced-repetition","title":"间隔重复与复习","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/practice/spaced-repetition"},{"seq":3,"slug":"workflow-maintenance","title":"工作流自动化与维护","url":"/h/personal-systems/knowledge-management-pkm/practice/workflow-maintenance"}]}]}